<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - J.P. MORGAN UPS APPLE.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - J.P. MORGAN UPS APPLE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Daniel Kunstler upgraded Apple Computer Inc to long-term buy from market performer.</p>
<p>-- said in a report news Wednesday of Microsoft Corp's $150 million investment in Apple and the overhauling of Apple's board &quot;was the best piece of Apple news we have heard for about as far back as we can remember.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said &quot;This looks to us like a benevolent conspiracy among the industry's elite to come to Apple's rescue.&quot;</p>
<p>-- stock was up 3-3/16 to 29-1/2.</p>
</text>
